    "created_at": "2016-10-19T08:25:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T08:25:49Z",
    "body": "FWIW, I'm inclined to remove the feature from the specification given that nobody has shipped anything here thus far and there's disagreement over how it should work. I'd rather remove something that is known to be incorrect and not shipped than keep it in place and hope for updates. And to be fair, we've been doing the latter for nine months now.\n\nThoughts?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
