    "created_at": "2016-10-19T13:36:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T13:36:06Z",
    "body": "Since this is a new feature under semi-active development, I'd support removing it from the spec and (assuming people are still interested in pursuing it) iterating on it via incubation instead.\n",
