    "created_at": "2016-10-19T13:50:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T13:50:37Z",
    "body": "That would be a fine outcome I think. If the feature can be sensibly described in a standalone doc then HTML could add integration points to limit monkey patching. Or if it requires deep integration it could be maintained as a fork of this repo.\n",
